        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Focus area</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>70.8% of recent road deaths sit in two intervention theatres</run>
