            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Major-city urban streets expose more vulnerable road users.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>The highest timing cell is Sunday daytime, showing that fatality risk is not only a late-night problem.</run>
